estion_id":"CQ-Q0104","citation_id":"smp-d7c7137ac5c847aaba82be212fc76255:22","title":"‎蝉妈妈-轻抖店直播数据巨量工作台 App - App Store","raw_url":"https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E8%9D%89%E5%A6%88%E5%A6%88-%E8%BD%BB%E6%8A%96%E5%BA%97%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%AD%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0/id1508944184?l=en-GB","normalized_url":"https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E8%9D%89%E5%A6%88%E5%A6%88-%E8%BD%BB%E6%8A%96%E5%BA%97%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%AD%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0/id1508944184?l=en-GB","host":"apps.apple.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0104","question_id":"CQ-Q0104","citation_id":"smp-d7c7137ac5c847aaba82be212fc76255:23","title":"蝉妈妈会员-蝉妈妈会员促销价格、蝉妈妈会员品牌 - 淘宝","raw_url":"https://mobile-phone.taobao.com/chanpin/86fa0a0d47def393cdb1cee998ef0aea.html","normalized_url":"https://mobile-phone.taobao.com/chanpin/86fa0a0d47def393cdb1cee998ef0aea.html","host":"mobile-phone.taobao.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0104","question_id":"CQ-Q0104","question_text":"蝉圈圈价格/费用是多少？","category":"品牌认知型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":23,"valid_url_cards":23,"unique_url_events":17,"official_events":4,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"05ee58734fb01d4284a1a560210d7ff038952f7f07bf1c6eadb394fb33dbca11","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 蝉圈圈（达人营销CRM）费用说明\n蝉圈圈**没有对外公开固定标价**，属于按企业需求定制报价的B端工具（蝉大师旗下产品，品牌达人CRM/达人营销管理系统）\n> ✅ **7天免费试用**：可以先申请试用，体验达人管理、样品跟进、达人库、数据追踪等基础能力\n\n## 套餐参考（行业公开参考区间，非官网固定价）\n1. **专业版**：约 **800元/月**，适合中小品牌、少量BD团队使用\n2. **企业版**：约 **3600元/年**，支持更多子账号、多店铺、企业级达人资产沉淀，适合中大型品牌/代运营公司\n\n> 抖店服务市场上标价0.01元一年的蝉圈圈商家版，一般是**体验/演示套餐**，不是完整正式商用版本，需要联系商务确认权限\n\n## 两类费用要区分开\n1. **蝉圈圈软件使用费**：上面的CRM系统订阅费，用来管理达人线索、合作流程、样品、数据复盘；\n2. **达人商单投放费（另外花钱）**：达人种草/带货合作，达人坑位费、佣金是单独结算，一号一价，由品牌直接和达人结算；蝉圈圈平台仅提供撮合工具，不包含达人内容服务费\n\n## 怎么获取准确报价\n联系蝉圈圈商务，提供：品牌、店铺数量、BD子账号数量、每月达人合作量级，获取实时正式报价与方案。\n\n如果你想，我可以帮你对比：蝉圈圈 vs 其他达人CRM工具（例如新抖、优达人等）的成本差异。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0104","question_id":"CQ-Q0104","citation_id":"smp-72b0bf62d2ca4497ae721c8583d18f29:1","title":"抖店服务市场-服务详情","raw_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?from=open_partner_svcList&service_id=32167","normalized_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?from=open_partner_svcList&service_id=32167","host":"fuwu.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0104","question_id":"CQ-Q0104","citation_id":"smp-72b0bf62d2ca4497ae721c8583d18f29:2","title":"一站式达人分销管理解决方案，破解营销管理难题 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/672.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/672.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0104","question_id":"CQ-Q0104","citation_id":"smp-72b0bf62d2ca4497ae721c8583d18f29:3","title":"蝉大师-蝉圈圈和Hubspot哪个好-有什么区别-优缺点-36氪企服点评","raw_url":"https://m.36dianping.com/vs/pueh.html","normalized_url":"https://m.36dianping.com/vs/pueh.html","host":"m.36dianping.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0104","question_id":"CQ-Q0104","citation_id":"smp-72b0bf62d2ca4497ae721c8583d18f29:4","title":"蝉圈圈达人营销CRM插件:一键解锁高效达人筛选与管理新体验 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/740.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/740.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q01